<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Strand posts H1 shr loss, no div.</title>
<headline>Strand posts H1 shr loss, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Feb 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre-exceps loss     2.5	   vs  2.1 profit</p>
<p>    - after exceps loss   2.5	   vs  5.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    -	    vs  1.43</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.76	  vs  2.95</p>
<p>    Tax			  -	    vs  -</p>
<p>    Turnover		  14.54	 vs  6.55</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	-	    vs  3.58</p>
<p>    Share of associates'   -	    vs  1.43</p>
<p>Full name: Strand Group Holdings</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said results for the second half were expected to improve on the first half but meaningful growth in earnings is only expectd from the 1998 financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
